  "notes": "Switchboard 1.23.0 — lower resource use, reliable logs, and safer configuration.",
  "highlights": [
    "Pause service logs without losing your place — service-panel logs now have a Pause control that stops collection while keeping displayed lines, then resumes with bounded recent output.",
    "Disabled tools are genuinely dormant — turning off a tool now stops its owned tasks and processes and unloads optional state, while hidden or inactive screens suspend work they do not currently need.",
    "Faster large logs and route loading — large log timelines process updates more efficiently, and app surfaces load only when needed."
